Vane redistributes prebuilt binary artifacts (the Swift XCFramework slices
and the Android .so libraries) that statically contain third-party code --
BoringSSL, quiche, rustls, ring and others. Their licenses and required
notices are in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md, which travels with those artifacts.
